OL,3,ATrump says Ukraine and Russia have
OL,4,Aagreed 'energy ceasefire'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump has been urging Ukraine to cease
OL,7,Fstrikes on Russian oil infrastructure -
OL,8,Fwhich Kyiv says are vital to curtailing
OL,9,Frevenue for Moscow's war machine - so
OL,10,Fit can fulfil a recently-struck deal to
OL,11,Frelease diesel to the US and the global
OL,12,Fmarket.
OL,14,FUkraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,15,Fsaid earlier on Sunday that he was
OL,16,Fwilling to halt the strikes if Russia
OL,17,Fceased targeting Ukrainian energy
OL,18,Finfrastructure, attacks which have been
OL,19,Fintensifying ahead of winter.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
