OL,3,APope Leo to have surgery after lump
OL,4,Afound on lung
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV has announced he will be
OL,7,Foperated on "in the coming days" after
OL,8,Fa nodule was found on his lung during a
OL,9,Fmedical check-up.
OL,11,F"The doctors found an early,
OL,12,Fwell-localised nodule on my lung," he
OL,13,Ftold the public during his weekly
OL,14,FSunday prayers in St Peter's Square in
OL,15,FRome.
OL,17,FThe 71-year-old said his medical team
OL,18,F"believe it would be right to
OL,19,Fintervene" and he had agreed to the
OL,20,Foperation, while reassuring pilgrims
OL,21,Fthat the mass was "well-contained" and
OL,22,Fcaught "at an early stage".
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
