OL,3,APope Leo to have surgery after lump
OL,4,Afound on lung
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pontiff's admission that he would
OL,7,Fneed surgery comes nearly a
OL,8,Fyear-and-a-half after he succeeded the
OL,9,Flate Pope Francis, who also experienced
OL,10,Fissues with his lungs that required
OL,11,Fhospital treatment.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
